

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

LegalEase is an AI-powered platform designed to simplify the creation of customizable, editable and professionally formatted legal documents.

2. MAIN FEATURES

• AI-powered legal document generation
• Customizable document content
• Editable generated text
• Document preview
• DOCX export
• PDF export
• HTML preview

3. SUPPORTED SCENARIOS

• Employment contracts
• Non-Disclosure Agreements (NDA)
• Residential lease agreements

4. TECHNOLOGY STACK

• Streamlit – Frontend
• FastAPI – Backend
• Google Gemini – AI generation
• Python – Core programming
• Python-docx – DOCX formatting
• FPDF – PDF generation

5. WORKFLOW

User enters details
↓
Input validation
↓
AI prompt construction
↓
Gemini generates legal content
↓
Formatting and preview
↓
Document export

6. PROJECT BENEFITS

• Saves time in document creation.
• Provides structured legal documents.
• Allows customization and editing.
• Supports multiple document formats.
• Provides a simple interactive workflow.

7. FUTURE ENHANCEMENTS

• Expand legal document templates.
• Improve input and clause validation.
• Add more testing for edge cases.
• Strengthen privacy and security controls.
• Provide a review step by a qualified legal professional.

